---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import caseCards from '../../data/ai-case-cards.json';
import '../../styles/ai-lab.css';
import {siteConfig} from '../../site-config.mjs';
import {supportEmail} from '../../lib/paid-product.mjs';
const starters=[
 ['Seller financing','What does Acquisition Companion teach about seller financing?'],
 ['Private credit','What does Acquisition Companion teach about private credit?'],
 ['Working capital','Why does working capital matter when buying a business?'],
 ['How much equity do I need?','What does the course say about buyer equity and capital requirements?'],
 ['How do roll-ups create value?','How do roll-ups create value according to the Acquisition Companion curriculum?'],
];
---
<Base title="AI Deal Lab" description="Ask a question, practice a fictional deal, or defend an acquisition thesis with the Acquisition Companion curriculum." type="AI Deal Lab" workspace>
 <div class="ai-app" data-ai-app data-case-cards={JSON.stringify(caseCards)}>
  <header class="ai-topbar">
   <a class="ai-workspace-brand" href="/" aria-label="Acquisition Companion home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">AC</span><div class="ai-brand-copy"><span>Acquisition Companion</span><h1>AI Deal Lab</h1></div></a>
   <nav class="ai-header-actions" aria-label="Workspace navigation" data-pagefind-ignore><a href="/course/">Back to course <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="ai-account-link" href="/account/" data-ai-account-link>Sign in</a><button type="button" class="button secondary ai-reset" data-reset>New session</button></nav>
  </header>
  <details class="ai-purpose">
   <summary>Why not just use ChatGPT?</summary>
   <div class="ai-purpose-copy">
    <p>You absolutely can use a general AI assistant. Acquisition Companion is designed for buyers who don’t want to build their own M&amp;A prompts, models and learning framework from scratch.</p>
    <p>The workspace connects valuation, financing, debt capacity, downside, diligence and structure across a short deal conversation. It applies the independently authored Acquisition Companion curriculum, source-linked material and deterministic calculations to support the reasoning, with explanations and guardrails for new buyers, plus fictional deal and IC practice. Source links identify material by its original creators; they do not imply creator involvement or endorsement.</p>
    <p>We don’t claim a smarter underlying model or exclusive capabilities. The value is the acquisition framework around it.</p>
   </div>
  </details>
  <p class="ai-free-paid-note">The course, topics, examples and source-linked educational material remain free. Deal Lab subscriptions support interactive AI analysis, deterministic calculations, deal-reasoning workflows, fictional deal practice and IC workflows, and associated model and compute costs.</p>
  <div class="ai-status" data-ai-status role="status" aria-live="polite" data-pagefind-ignore>Checking AI Deal Lab availability…</div>
  <p class="small ai-access-notice" data-ai-access hidden><span data-ai-access-message></span> <a href="/pricing/" data-ai-access-pricing>View pricing</a> <a href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`} data-ai-access-request hidden>Request beta access</a></p>
  <div class="ai-workspace" data-ai-workspace data-pagefind-ignore>
   <aside class="ai-rail" data-mode-rail aria-label="Learning modes">
    <p class="eyebrow ai-rail-heading">Ask · Practice · Defend</p>
    <label class="ai-mobile-mode-label" for="ai-mode-select">Learning mode</label>
    <select class="ai-mobile-mode-select" id="ai-mode-select" data-mode-select><option value="ask_course">Ask the Course</option><option value="deal_lab">Deal Lab</option><option value="ic_challenge">IC Challenge</option></select>
    <nav class="ai-mode-switch" aria-label="Choose an AI Deal Lab mode">
     <button type="button" class="ai-mode-card" data-mode="ask_course" aria-pressed="true"><span aria-hidden="true">01</span>Ask the Course</button>
     <button type="button" class="ai-mode-card" data-mode="deal_lab" aria-pressed="false"><span aria-hidden="true">02</span>Deal Lab</button>
     <div class="ai-rail-cases" data-context-mode="deal_lab" hidden><p class="ai-case-choice-label">Practice cases</p>{caseCards.map(item=><button type="button" class="ai-case-choice" data-case-choice={item.id} aria-pressed="false"><span>{item.title}</span><small>{item.difficulty}</small></button>)}</div>
     <button type="button" class="ai-mode-card" data-mode="ic_challenge" aria-pressed="false"><span aria-hidden="true">03</span>IC Challenge</button>
     <div class="ai-rail-cases" data-context-mode="ic_challenge" hidden><p class="ai-case-choice-label">Committee cases</p>{caseCards.map(item=><button type="button" class="ai-case-choice" data-case-choice={item.id} aria-pressed="false"><span>{item.title}</span><small>{item.difficulty}</small></button>)}</div>
    </nav>
    <div class="ai-mobile-cases" data-mobile-cases hidden><label for="ai-mobile-case-select">Synthetic case</label><select id="ai-mobile-case-select" data-case-select>{caseCards.map(item=><option value={item.id}>{item.title} · {item.difficulty}</option>)}</select></div>
    <p class="ai-rail-note">A learning workspace for acquisition reasoning.<br /><a href="/methodology/">How the course uses sources</a></p>
   </aside>
   <section class="ai-conversation-panel" aria-labelledby="ai-conversation-heading">
    <div class="ai-conversation-header"><p class="eyebrow" data-active-mode-label>Ask the Course</p><h2 id="ai-conversation-heading" data-active-heading>Source-grounded course tutor</h2></div>
    <div class="ai-thread-viewport" data-thread-viewport tabindex="0" aria-label="Scrollable conversation">
     <div class="ai-conversation" data-conversation role="log" aria-label="AI Deal Lab conversation" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions text">
      <div class="ai-empty-state" data-empty-state>
       <div data-empty-mode="ask_course"><h2>Ask Acquisition Companion</h2><p>Get source-grounded answers from the Acquisition Companion curriculum.</p></div>
       <div data-empty-mode="deal_lab" hidden><h2>Practice your acquisition reasoning.</h2><p>Choose a fictional deal. Work through the facts, test your assumptions, and learn one stage at a time.</p></div>
       <div data-empty-mode="ic_challenge" hidden><h2>Defend an acquisition thesis.</h2><p>Bring your reasoning to a simulated investment committee. Expect one focused challenge at a time.</p></div>
      </div>
     </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-composer-dock">
     <div class="ai-case-actions" data-case-actions hidden>
      <button type="button" class="button" data-start-case>Start this case</button>
      <details class="ai-learning-actions" data-stage-actions hidden open><summary>Learning actions <span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></summary><div class="ai-action-chips">
       <button type="button" class="button secondary" data-command="hint">Give me a hint</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-command="explain">Explain this</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-command="what_did_i_miss">What did I miss?</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-command="challenge_assumptions">Challenge my assumptions</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-command="reveal_next">Reveal next stage</button><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-command="show_answer">Show the answer</button><button type="button" class="button" data-command="complete" data-complete hidden>Complete the IC Challenge</button>
      </div></details>
     </div>
     <form class="ai-compose" data-ai-form>
      <label for="ai-message">Your question or reasoning</label><textarea id="ai-message" name="message" rows="3" maxlength="1500" placeholder="Ask an acquisition question…" required aria-describedby="ai-compose-limit"></textarea>
      <div class="ai-compose-footer"><p id="ai-compose-limit">Up to 1,500 characters</p><button type="submit" class="button" data-submit disabled>Send question</button></div>
      <div class="ai-starters" data-starter-prompts aria-label="Suggested starter questions">{starters.map(([label,prompt])=><button type="button" data-starter-prompt={prompt}>{label}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>)}</div>
     </form>
     <div class="ai-error" data-ai-error role="alert" hidden><p data-error-message></p><button type="button" class="button secondary" data-retry hidden>Retry</button></div>
     <p class="ai-privacy-notice"><strong>Practice with fictional deals.</strong> Do not paste confidential, proprietary, personal, or non-public deal information. <a href="/privacy/#ai-deal-lab">Privacy</a>{siteConfig.analytics.measurementId && <><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><button class="footer-link" data-analytics-preferences>Analytics preferences</button></>}</p>
    </div>
   </section>
   <details class="ai-context-panel" data-context-panel open tabindex="0" aria-label="Sources and practice context">
    <summary><span id="ai-context-label" data-context-summary>Sources</span><span class="ai-context-disclosure" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
    <div class="ai-context-body" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-labelledby="ai-context-label">
     <section data-context-mode="ask_course"><p class="eyebrow">Curriculum</p><h2>Sources for this answer</h2></section>
     <section data-context-mode="deal_lab" hidden><p class="eyebrow">Original synthetic exercise</p><h2>Case file</h2><h3 class="ai-case-title" data-case-title></h3><p class="ai-case-meta" data-case-meta></p><p class="ai-case-description" data-case-description></p><div class="ai-case-facts" data-case-facts></div></section>
     <section data-context-mode="ic_challenge" hidden><p class="eyebrow">Educational simulation</p><h2>Committee brief</h2><h3 class="ai-case-title" data-case-title></h3><p class="ai-case-meta" data-case-meta></p><p class="ai-case-description" data-case-description></p><div class="ai-case-facts" data-case-facts></div></section>
     <section class="ai-calculations" data-calculations hidden><p class="eyebrow">Deterministic case math</p><h2>Canonical figures</h2><div class="ai-calculations-content" data-calculations-content></div></section>
     <section class="ai-feedback" data-feedback hidden><p class="eyebrow">Qualitative debrief</p><h2>Committee feedback</h2><div class="ai-feedback-content" data-feedback-content></div></section>
     <section class="ai-citations"><h3 class="ai-case-sources-label" data-case-source-label hidden>Course sources for this answer</h3><div data-citations><p class="muted">Sources will appear here after an answer.</p></div></section>
     <p class="ai-context-note" data-context-note>Course sources explain concepts. Fictional case facts are Acquisition Companion original exercises and are not attributed to videos or guides.</p>
    </div>
   </details>
  </div>
 </div>
 <noscript><p class="notice">AI Deal Lab needs JavaScript to send a question. You can still study the <a href="/course/">free course</a> and <a href="/topics/">topic library</a>.</p></noscript>
 <script src="../../scripts/ai-lab.ts"></script>
</Base>
